/T (Over the past 2.5+ years, IITMZ has made steady strides: adding 1 more BS programme in Chemical Process Engineering in 2025, focussed on developing human capacity for the burgeoning process industry in the resource-rich continent of African. IITMZ today has over 129 students on roll across various programs, with significant features including having almost 51% students from Tanzania, a strong female participation across the disciplines, and enrolment of about 8% students from other African countries \(Ethiopia, Zambia, Kenya, etc.\).)
/E (Over the past 2.5+ years, IITMZ has made steady strides: adding 1 more BS programme in Chemical Process Engineering in 2025, focussed on developing human capacity for the burgeoning process industry in the resource-rich continent of African. IITMZ today has over 129 students on roll across various programs, with significant features including having almost 51% students from Tanzania, a strong female participation across the disciplines, and enrolment of about 8% students from other African countries \(Ethiopia, Zambia, Kenya, etc.\).)
