<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 60 0 R
/E (The BS DSAI program at IITM Zanzibar prepares students for the fast-evolving fields of data science and artificial intelligence. The curriculum combines foundational science and math with specialized DSAI subjects, emphasizing practical, project-based learning in data analysis, machine learning, and natural language processing. Graduates are highly sought after for diverse roles like Data Analyst/Scientist, Machine Learning Engineer, and Business Analyst across various industries, and are also equipped for entrepreneurship or advanced studies.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
150 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 60 0 R
/E (The 2-year MTech in Ocean Structures at IITM Zanzibar offers a rigorous curriculum in the design of offshore platforms, renewable energy structures \(wind, wave, tidal\), and port/harbor infrastructure \(jetties, berths, breakwaters, dredging\), with core courses in Wave Hydrodynamics, Offshore Structures, and Port & Harbour Structures. Emphasizing hands-on lab work and industry projects, the program develops research aptitude and job-ready skills. Graduates are highly sought after in the coastal and offshore engineering fields, securing roles in government and private sectors within the global port, harbor, and energy markets, shaping sustainable maritime solutions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
