/P 60 0 R
/E (The 2-year MTech DSAI program at IITM Zanzibar offers advanced knowledge and specialized skills in data science and artificial intelligence, preparing students for leadership roles in industry and research. The curriculum includes rigorous coursework, research projects, and practical training in areas like machine learning, deep learning, and big data analytics, guided by renowned faculty. Graduates are highly sought after, with diverse career opportunities as Data Scientists, Machine Learning Engineers, AI Researchers, and more, across various industries.)
/Pg 13 0 R
